    "App 会连接用户主动配置的音乐服务器。缺少可用时间轴歌词时，会按需把歌曲名、艺人、专辑名和时长发送给 LRCLIB 与中文歌词聚合服务；浏览缺少封面的内容时，会把对应名称发送给中文封面聚合服务。不会发送账号、服务器地址或播放记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app connects to music servers you configure. When usable synchronized lyrics are missing, the track title, artist, album and duration are sent on demand to LRCLIB and a Chinese lyrics aggregator. When browsing content without artwork, the corresponding names are sent to a Chinese artwork aggregator. Accounts, server addresses and playback history are never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 图标和界面视觉均为本项目原创，界面图标使用 Apple SF Symbols。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app icon and visual design are original to this project. Interface icons use Apple SF Symbols."
          }
        }
      }
    },
