    "产品官网" : {

    },
    "仅在系统授权期间读取用户选择的本地或 NAS 文件夹，并把音频复制到 App 私有资料库。SMB 凭据由系统“文件”管理，App 不读取或保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reads user-selected local or NAS folders and copies audio to the App private library only during system authorization. SMB credentials are managed by the system \"file\" and are not read or saved by the App."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅应在你确认服务器身份后启用。此设置只作用于当前音乐源，不会降低其他网络请求的安全性。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enable this only after verifying the server. This setting applies only to the current music source and does not weaken other network requests."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "优先使用下载的时间轴歌词，并过滤内嵌广告文本" : {
