    "凭据会从 Keychain 删除。你可以选择是否同时删除该音乐源的缓存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Credentials will be removed from Keychain. You can also choose whether to delete this source’s cache."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凭据只保留在当前 App 进程内，不会写入磁盘。真机与正式版本始终使用 Keychain。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Credentials are only retained within the current app process and are not written to disk. Real machines and official versions always use Keychain."
